 "description": "List currently popular Pexels videos, optionally filtered by minimum width/height and duration range. Returns compact video objects. Read-only. `video_files` is trimmed to the highest-resolution renditions (see `video_files_count` for the full count) \u2014 call pexels_get_video for the complete rendition list on one video.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
